---
---

<section id="about" class="relative scroll-mt-20 overflow-hidden bg-base">
  <!-- Ambient color field: mirrors the index hero's soft editorial haze -->
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="absolute -left-24 -top-24 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-exp-tint blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute right-[-6rem] top-10 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-folio-tint blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-[-8rem] left-1/3 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-edu-tint blur-3xl"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pb-20 pt-16 sm:px-8 sm:pt-24 lg:pt-28">
    <p class="font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-ink-soft">
      My Story
    </p>

    <h1
      class="mt-4 max-w-3xl font-display text-5xl font-semibold leading-[1.1] text-ink sm:text-6xl"
    >
      More than <em class="italic text-exp-deep">just a learner</em>
    </h1>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink">
        I'm <strong class="font-semibold">Akmal Keisin</strong>, a full-stack developer with four
        years of experience turning complex problems into elegant, maintainable software. I started
        building websites at 18 and never stopped.
      </p>
      <p class="font-display text-xl leading-snug text-ink-soft">
        The modern tech stack shifts constantly. Mastering it requires an autodidactic mindset —
        driven by continuous learning and highly disciplined study. We are engineers, not magicians:
        true expertise means understanding how the underlying systems work.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
      {["PHP", "Laravel", "MySQL", "PostgreSQL", "TypeScript", "Vue", "Go", "Astro"].map((s) => (
        <span class="rounded-full border border-ink/10 bg-base px-4 py-2 text-sm text-ink-soft">
          {s}
        </span>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
